  pages:
  - promptText: A desperate village pleads for your aid. A band of ruthless marauders
      has descended upon their homes, leaving fear and ruin in their wake. Lucky
      for them, you handily cast out these barbarians. The villagers approach you
      to offer thanks.
    choices:
    - buttonText: Spreading my feats far and wide will suffice as thanks! (Gain 1
        [EXPERIENCE]).
      previewUnit: {fileID: 0}
      rollRandomRarity: 1
      previewRarity: 0
      generateRandomUnitPreview: 0
      anyRegion: 0
      randomRegion: 0
      preferredTags: 0
      excludePlayerRegion: 0
      previewTactic: {fileID: 0}
      generateRandomTacticPreview: 0
      outcomes:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: ec2bd3a307c5a0346a76e2ef83dbeea4, type: 2}
      condition: {fileID: 0}
    - buttonText: Oh, I wouldn't say freed. More like, under new management. (Lose
        1 [EXPERIENCE], gain 10 [GOLD]).
      previewUnit: {fileID: 0}
      rollRandomRarity: 1
      previewRarity: 0
      generateRandomUnitPreview: 0
      anyRegion: 1
      randomRegion: 0
      preferredTags: 0
